{"id": "33985", "title": "梦的衣裳", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 15, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33985.htm", "intro": "当父亲再娶了几乎和她同年纪的曼如后，雅晴就不再是父亲唯一的爱了。她不愿待在家里而到处闲逛，却因此遇见桑尔旋，一连串的变化，从此改变了她的一生。她能扮演好桑桑的角色吗？在桑尔旋和万皓然之间，她又将情归何处呢？……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33985", "chapters": [{"title": "第1节", "file": "2160624.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2节", "file": "2160625.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3节", "file": "2160626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4节", "file": "2160627.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5节", "file": "2160628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6节", "file": "2160629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7节", "file": "2160630.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8节", "file": "2160631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9节", "file": "2160632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10节", "file": "2160633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11节", "file": "2160634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12节", "file": "2160635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13节", "file": "2160636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14节", "file": "2160637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15节", "file": "2160638.html", "available": false}]}